# 3-Layer Sector Reclassification System

## Results Summary

| Metric | Value |
|--------|-------|
| **Total rows** | 1,100 |
| **Reclassified** | 350 (31.8%) |
| **Unchanged** | 750 (68.2%) |
| **"Other" reduced** | 172 → 106 (−38%) |
| **Coverage** | 93.2% classified into real sectors |

## Layer Performance

| Layer | Rows | Coverage | Confidence |
|-------|------|----------|------------|
| 🏷️ **Layer 1** — Name Lookup | 349 | 31.7% | 🟢 High |
| 🔍 **Layer 2** — Regex Match | 655 | 59.5% | 🟡 Medium |
| 💰 **Layer 3** — Investor Inference | 21 | 1.9% | 🔴 Low |
| ❓ **Fallback** — Other | 75 | 6.8% | 🔴 Low |

## Key Corrections Caught

The system correctly identified and fixed these common mislabellings:

| Startup | Was Labelled | Now Corrected To | Layer |
|---------|-------------|------------------|-------|
| **Razorpay** | EdTech ❌ | **Fintech** ✅ | Name Lookup |
| **BYJU'S** | AgriTech ❌ | **Edtech** ✅ | Name Lookup |
| **BharatPe** | SaaS ❌ | **Fintech** ✅ | Name Lookup |
| **Lenskart** | FinTech ❌ | **Ecommerce/D2C** ✅ | Name Lookup |
| **Unacademy** | HealthTech ❌ | **Edtech** ✅ | Name Lookup |
| **HealthAnalytics** | Consumer Electronics ❌ | **Healthtech** ✅ | Regex |

